sometimes exceed the 260-unit warehouse limit, and the excess is lost. Over a 3-day cycle, demand varies by about ±20 units, so a 5–15 % margin will sometimes run short at the end of a cycle.\n- Plan 6 has smaller deliveries, so it carries less capacity and shortage risk, but it saves less on fees.\n\n**Verdict.** The fee savings (560–730) probably outweigh the extra shortages, so plans 5 and 6 are the most likely winners. Among the daily plans, the ones with a larger margin (2, 7, 0) are better than the lean ones (1, 3, 4)."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 6764, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 6764}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T21:30:04.420Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVM4VbpgiRNFdoyA4qFa"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_019QWyGx8FfgesHXN41qfTAD", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVM4VqCxeS4nV471YcUU", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_019QWyGx8FfgesHXN41qfTAD", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.08, 0.02, 0.12, 0.03, 0.05, 0.3, 0.3, 0.1]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 6764, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "cache_creation": {"eph